+    therefore cannot see what the sublayer produced.  Here each of the four insertion
+    points is its own module with its own projection, so the post-sublayer convs read the
+    POST-sublayer hidden -- strictly more information.  Same taps, same insertion points,
+    and (at 5 layers, hidden 2560, group 16) the same 16,486,400 parameters: 20 modules
+    of one side each against 10 modules of two.  The parameter count is a coincidence of
+    that arithmetic and constrains nothing about the function.
